WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.038 --> 00:00:03.852
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:03.853 --> 00:00:06.844
What do they see?

3
00:00:06.845 --> 00:00:09.398
They see a zoo.

4
00:00:09.399 --> 00:00:14.917
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:14.918 --> 00:00:37.916
They move like monkeys.

6
00:00:37.917 --> 00:00:49.581
They move like penguins.

7
00:00:49.582 --> 00:01:09.032
They move like rhinos.

8
00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:20.910
They move like kangaroos.

9
00:01:20.911 --> 00:01:48.265
They move like bears.

10
00:01:48.266 --> 00:02:18.002
They move like crocodiles.

11
00:02:18.003 --> 00:02:25.677
Blobs, do you hear that noise?

12
00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:30.693
Oh. It's a cricket.

13
00:02:30.694 --> 00:02:37.313
The blobs move really fast!

14
00:02:37.314 --> 00:02:39.250
Silly blobs!

15
00:02:39.251 --> 00:02:41.915
Good-bye!

